From: MCelliotG <mcelliotg@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] welle-e2: publish FIG programme type separately from genre

Retain early and late FIG 0/17 PTY and the FIG 0/9 International Table
Identifier. Publish numeric pty/ptyTable snapshots only when metadata changes.
Keep translated names in Enigma2 and preserve legacy programType semantics.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OpenATV frontend]

